{"id":"sich","lemma":"sich","pos":"pron","rank":36,"glosses":["oneself, himself, herself, itself, themselves","each other"],"ipa":"/zɪç/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/e/ea/De-sich.ogg/De-sich.ogg.mp3","examples":[{"text":"Wie fühlen Sie sich heute?","en":"How do you feel today?","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/760677","words":[{"g":"how"},{"g":"to feel"},{"g":"she / they / you"},null,{"g":"today"}]},{"text":"Er kann sich kein Auto kaufen.","en":"He can't buy a car.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/393471","words":[{"g":"he / it"},{"g":"can, to be able to","l":"können"},null,{"g":"no / not a"},{"g":"car"},{"g":"to buy, to purchase"}]},{"text":"Wollen Sie es sich ansehen?","en":"Do you want to look at it?","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/711671","words":[{"g":"to want"},{"g":"she / they / you"},{"g":"it"},null,{"g":"to look at"}]},{"text":"Können Sie sich bewegen?","en":"Can you move?","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/699114","words":[{"g":"can, to be able to"},{"g":"she / they / you"},null,{"g":"to move"}]},{"text":"Dinge können sich ändern.","en":"Things can change.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/701209","words":[{"g":"thing","l":"Ding"},{"g":"can, to be able to"},null,{"g":"to change, to alter"}]}]}